  sentences:
  - name: Brother
    text: "\u2026You want to clean it?  Hold on. Just-"
  - name: Brother
    text: "\u2026 give me a second."
  - name: Brother
    text: "People don\u2019t ask nowadays."
  - name: Brother
    text: "She\u2019s my sister. Do you think they should? \u2026 Alright. Yes. You
      can."
  - name: Brother
    text: "Just don\u2019t rush. Please."
